#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Manage Your ESG Impacts with the ESG App</strong>"
msgstr ""

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Manage leads and client relationships with CRM</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Управлявайте потенциални клиенти и клиентски взаимоотношения с CRM</"
"strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Manage tasks </strong>by organizing them into stages such as 'To "
"Do,' 'In Progress,' and 'Done,' <strong>while collaborating with the team</"
"strong> by assigning deadlines and responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Управлявайте задачите</strong>, като ги организирате на етапи като "
"„За изпълнение“, „В процес“ и „Готово“, <strong>докато си сътрудничите с "
"екипа</strong>, като задавате крайни срокове и отговорности."

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Structure and track impactful projects</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Структурирайте и проследявайте въздействащи проекти</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Track billable hours for consulting services</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Проследявайте фактурируемите часове за консултантски услуги</strong>"

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Upload key documents</strong>, such as client reports and regulatory "
"guidelines, directly into the dedicated project folder, accessible via the "
"smart button on the project page or in the <strong>Document App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Качете ключови документи</strong>, като клиентски отчети и "
"регулаторни указания, директно в специализираната папка на проекта, достъпна "
"чрез умния бутон на страницата на проекта или в приложението "
"<strong>Документи</strong>."

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.appointments_selection_layout_oe_structure_appointments_card_bottom
msgid ""
"A Discovery Call is a broad, 30-minute introductory consultation where we "
"assess your overall compliance needs, audit readiness (such as ISO 14001), "
"and Scope 1–3 reporting goals."
msgstr ""

#. module: environmental_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:environmental_agency.appointments_selection_layout_oe_structure_appointments_card_bottom
msgid ""
